Before any search, command, plan, review, or edit, read
`docs/ai/PROJECT_RULES.md` completely and comply with it.

Non-overridable constraints: never commit or push; never discard existing user
changes; never expose secrets; inspect Git status before editing; keep changes
task-scoped; report only verification that was actually run.

